          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "* 通过计算修正值以保证在结果里所有四个数字都是有效数字.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 232,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0238#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "查表求出$\\sqrt{2.45}$的值：$\\sqrt{2.45}\\approx1.565$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "那么$\\sqrt{245}=\\sqrt{2.45}\\times10\\approx1.565\\times10=15.65$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "5. 求$\\sqrt{5634}$的值.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们把5634写成$56.34\\times10^2$，那么$\\sqrt{56.34\\times10^2}=\\sqrt{56.34}\\times10$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "查表求出$\\sqrt{56.3}\\approx7.503$. 在修正值表编号为4的直行里找到修正值3，把它加到7.503的最后一个数字上，得到：$\\sqrt{56.34}\\approx7.506$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "于是，$\\sqrt{5634}=10\\sqrt{56.34}\\approx75.06$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "6. 求$\\sqrt{0.235}$的值.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "0.235比23.5小100倍. （23.5的平方根可通过查表求出. ）因此$\\sqrt{0.235}=\\sqrt{23.5\\times10^{-2}}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为$\\sqrt{23.5\\times10^{-2}}=\\sqrt{23.5}\\times10^{-1}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "所以$\\sqrt{0.235}=\\sqrt{23.5}\\times10^{-1}\\approx4.848\\times10^{-1}=0.4848$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "一般地，为了求出小于1或大于100的正数的平方根，应当把这个数写成$a\\times10^{2k}$（$1\\leq a<100$，$k$是整数），再利用关于积的平方根的定理求得结果.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0239#11"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
